    {
      "layout": "title-content",
      "title": "Vom Spiel zum Modell",
      "body": "Übergangsdiagramm: Tragt an den\nvier Pfeilen ein, welcher Anteil der Münzen jeweils im selben Feld bleibt oder\nin das andere Feld wechselt.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n  \n  bleibt in A:\n  ______\n  \n  \n   \n  \n  \n  bleibt in B:\n  ______\n  \n \n \n  \n  A\n  \n  \n  A \n  ───────→  B\n  \n  A  ←───────  B\n  \n  \n  B\n  \n \n \n  \n   \n  \n  \n  Anteil A nach\n  B: ______     Anteil B nach A: ______\n  \n  \n   \n  \n \n\n\nÜbergangstabelle\n\n\n\n\n \n  \n  nach / von\n  \n  \n  A\n  \n  \n  B\n  \n \n \n  \n  A\n  \n  \n  ________\n  \n  \n  ________\n  \n \n \n  \n  B\n  \n  \n  ________\n  \n  \n  ________",
      "speakerNotes": "",
      "preparationNotes": "",
      "materialNotes": "",
      "subtitle": "",
      "bodyLeft": "",
      "bodyRight": "",
      "imagePath": "",
      "imageCaption": "",
      "bodyStyle": "plain",
      "titleAlign": "left",
      "accentColor": "#2E7D32",
      "titleHtml": "<p><b>Vom Spiel zum Modell</b></p>",
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:2.0pt;\nmargin-left:0cm\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\">Übergangsdiagramm:&nbsp;</span></b></span>Tragt an den\nvier Pfeilen ein, welcher Anteil der Münzen jeweils im selben Feld bleibt oder\nin das andere Feld wechselt.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:2.0pt;\nmargin-left:0cm\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\">\n\n\n\n<!--EndFragment--></span></p><div align=\"center\">\n\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-layout-alt:fixed;mso-yfti-tbllook:\n 1184;mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt\">\n <tbody><tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:0;mso-yfti-firstrow:yes\">\n  <td width=\"232\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:173.75pt;padding:2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">bleibt in A:\n  ______</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td width=\"232\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:173.75pt;padding:2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td width=\"232\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:173.75pt;padding:2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">bleibt in B:\n  ______</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow:1\">\n  <td width=\"232\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:173.75pt;background:#D9E7F7;padding:\n  2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">A</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td width=\"232\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:173.75pt;padding:2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">A<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp;\n  </span>───────→<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp; </span>B<br>\n  <br>\n  A<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp; </span>←───────<span style=\"mso-spacerun:yes\">&nbsp; </span>B</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n  </td>\n  <td width=\"232\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:173.75pt;background:#D9E7F7;padding:\n  2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt 2.0pt\">\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span data-pres-font=\"&quot;Aptos&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif\" style=\"font-family: Aptos, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Calibri, Arial, sans-serif !important;\"><b style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">B</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\n  </td>\n </tr>\n <tr